  "description": "The Vaporesso GTX One Pro Mod combines dependable power with a clear, easy interface. A built-in 3000mAh battery delivers 5–40W of adjustable output, managed by the AXON chip for smooth, consistent performance. USB-C 2A charging keeps downtime to a minimum. The 0.87-inch OLED screen is designed for quick checks at a glance, showing seven key indicators: battery level, wattage, resistance, puff counter, mode, lock status and Smart on/off. One-handed control is simple — long-press to fire, three clicks to enter the menu, and five clicks to power on/off. A physical lock button secures your settings when you’re on the move, and a silicone base adds extra grip and protection. Choose between comfortable silicone with unique marbled patterns, or premium PU leather. Colours: Black, Silver, Red, Blue, Pink and Brown. Check out our vape juice and pair it perfectly with this kit.",
